        ### Shell edits are not captured
        
      → Snapshotting skips files that shell commands touch, so a restore leaves them as they are:
        
        ```bash theme={null}
        rm lorem.txt
        mv ipsum.txt dolor.txt
        cp sit.txt amet.txt
        ...
        
